4	       - an open question: a message answering it;
5	       - a page that differs from its approved screen: Show, which puts it in
6	         the design surface, since only the person can say if it's right;
7	       - a proposed rule no page shows: a message asking to show it;
8	       - where the last session ended: a message carrying on.
9	     Picking one starts the message in the box (as Answer does), to add to
10	     or send; nothing is sent until the person sends it. They go when the
11	     session's first message is sent.
